`ProfileView` shows the login when a Profile has no full name, instead of "Unnamed user". It fell back to `content.title`, which a Profile never carries: `title` is computed on the backend rather than stored, so `plone.restapi` does not serialize it, and the test fixture supplied one no real payload has. The heading now follows the same order the backend's own `Title()` does — full name, login, userid. @ericof
